          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765490332403_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "From the following content:\n{{$context.$nodes.CALLSKILLGAPINVOKEACTION.$output.output}}\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n- Do NOT repeat the course title anywhere outside the cardWidget\n- Do NOT use labels such as Description, Overview, Summary, or Course Value Summary\n- ALL explanatory text must appear under explicit labels defined below\n\nSTEP 1 — Display labeled course context OUTSIDE of any widget.\n\nUse ONLY the labels listed below.\nDisplay a label ONLY if the corresponding information is explicitly available in the content.\nDo NOT infer or assume missing values.\n\n***Why this course is recommended:***\n- Rewrite the available course description into EXACTLY 2–3 concise sentences\n- Clearly explain the value, purpose, and practical benefit of the course\n- Do NOT include metadata or role names here\n\nDuration:\nDelivery Mode:\nLevel:\n\nFormatting rules for STEP 1:\n- The “Why this course is recommended” label MUST be bold and italic exactly as shown\n- Other labels must remain normal text\n- Omit any label entirely if data is not available\n- No paragraphs without labels\n- No duplicated titles\n- No actions\n- No widgets\n\nSTEP 2 — Display EXACTLY ONE cardWidget.\nThis card is a LIGHT VALUE CARD only.\n\ncardWidget rules (STRICT):\n- Title: {{learningItemTitle}}   ← use title ONLY here\n- Body:\n    - one or two short sentences ONLY\n    - Explain how the course helps the learner professionally\n    - No labels\n    - No metadata\n    - No repetition of STEP 1 content\n\nInclude EXACTLY ONE action:\n\n{\n\"text\": \"Enroll in Course\",\n\"action\": \"ora.Invoke(\\\"ENROLL\\\", {\\\"actionCode\\\": \\\"ENROLL\\\", \\\"learningItemId\\\": learningItemId, \\\"title\\\": learningItemTitle})\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_CARD"
              ],
              "enableActions": false,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
